          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili kudi kaprofwetu Yeremiya dakutena nyuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "DaEjipitu. Dakutena njita yamwanta wakuEjipitu Fwaro Neko yadiŋi kukaloŋa Yufurati, muKarikemishi atapiliyi mwanta wakuKushi Babiloni Nebukaneza mumwaka wamuchiwana waYehoyakimi mwana kaYosiya, mwanta wawaYuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Loŋeshenu ninkebu janyanya ninkebu jamaneni, mukundami kwakwihi nanjita, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kasakasenu tuwalu, mukandamuhu enu akwakwendela hatuwalu, imanenu iwu nahindi, iwu nahindi, namatepenu ayikuŋu. Kosakosenu mayoŋa, vwalenu yikovwelu yatumaleŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami namwenidi chumichi? Anahayami hiyakufuntafunta hanyima. Ayilobu jawu kotu-kotu, anatemuki lufuchi nikutala hanyima nehi. Mutentu niniku niniku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asweja lufuchi bayi atemukaku. Chilobu bayi apulukaku. Kukabeta kakuchimunswa, kukaloŋa Yufurati, anahukani, anadimbuki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeniwu hinyi wudi nakunana neyi Nile, wukweti meji akubenkaŋila neyi tuloŋa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejipitu hakunana neyi Nile, meji indi hiyakubenkaŋila neyi tuloŋa. Nindi, Nukunyamuka, nukujika iseki wi-i. Nukujilumuna mukala niantu ashakamamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu tuwalu, nyamukenu. Enu makálu, kindenu, ayilobu ediki. NiKushi, niPuti, akwataŋa kunkebu. NiaLudi, akwataŋa kuwuta wamukunji, awevulaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hiifuku daMwanta Yehova wamazaza, hiifuku dakutenda, kulonda akaditendi hadi akwankunyi nindi. Mpoku yakabali yakadya, yakekuta, yakanwa mashi awu nimpwila ngwa, muloŋa Mwanta, Yehova wamazaza, wakaketula chimuna kwituŋa dakuchimunswa kukaloŋa Yufurati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kaEjipitu wamujiki, nyamukaku wuyi muGileyadi, wakatambwiluku yitumbu. Wudi nakukabakana tuhu nakudikwita yitumbu yeŋi nayeŋi, hikudi kukúukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza yinatiyi dehi nsaŋu yansonyi yeyi, iseki dejima dawanina dehi kwanyiteti yeyi hohu. Muloŋa chilobu nadimbukili hadi chilobu nindi, mwayedi wawu anadimbukili hamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu dahosheliyi Yehova nakaprofwetu Yeremiya, dakutena chakenzayi mwanta wakuBabiloni Nebukaneza nakutapa ituŋa daEjipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Shimunenu muEjipitu, chitiyakeshenu muMigidoli, chitiyakeshenu muNofwi nimuTapanesi. Ilenu nenu, Imanenu mudiloŋeshi. Muloŋa mpoku yakabali yadya dehi kwi-ndo, eyi mukachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu eyi akwaŋovu anakumpukilidi? Kwimana kwawu nehi, muloŋa Yehova diyi nayihaŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena nadimbwishi amavulu, eŋa, iwu hakudimbukila hadi mukwawu, iwu hakudimbukila hadi mukwawu. Nawu, Nyamukenu tuyenu cheŋi kudi akwetu, kwituŋa ditwasemukilili, tuchini mpoku yakabali yatukabishaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abidikili kwenoku nawu, Mwanta wakuEjipitu Fwaro hiipumba tuhu. Mpinji yamufuukwililuwu yinamuhiti dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta nindi, Chochinahandami, nikweti ijina daYehova wamazaza kwaamu, chalala wakenza neyi Tabori mukachi kamapidi, neyi Karameli kukaluŋalwŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana wamumbanda washakama muEjipitu, kasakasaku yuma yeyi, wuyi muwukoli, muloŋa Nofwi wakabalumuka kwayihembi hohu, wakasukuma, wakekala wakadi antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejipitu hiiyoŋa daŋombi wamukaji wasweja lubanji. Kujilumuka kunafumi kukabeta kakuchimunswa, kwenza dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu indi akukamba namali adi mukachi kawu adi neyi gombi jakudiisha, muloŋa niwena anabalumuki dehi, anatemukili dehi kumu, kwimana nehi. Muloŋa ifuku dawu dakumona kukala dinayiwani dehi, yoyi mpinji yakuyihempula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muswalu windi wudi neyi muswalu wakapela wudi nakwenda. Muloŋa akenda nanjita, akenza nakulwa nindi nayizembi, neyi akwakuchaya nchawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Akatema isaŋa dindi hela dasweja kujika. Muloŋa wena abadika atubola kuvula, kutwesha kuyichinda nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaEjipitu wamumbanda akamutiyisha nsonyi. Akamuhana kudi antu akukabeta kakuchimunswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza, Nzambi yaIsarela, nindi, Tiyenu, nakababesha Amoni wakuNo, niFwaro, niEjipitu, niakishi indi, nianyanta jindi; wowu aFwaro nawantu ejima amukuhwelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayihana kudi antu akukeŋa kuyijaha, nikudi Nebukaneza mwanta wakuBabiloni, nikudi ambuŋindi. Nkumininaku antu amba kashakamamu cheŋi neyi chadinuwu hanyaka. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyi kambuŋami Yakoba, bayi wutiya womaku; eyi Isarela, bayi wakamaku, muloŋa tiya, ami nakakwamwina chakukufumisha kwakulehi, nakaamwina nianyaneyi chakuyifumisha mwituŋa danamwenuwu wukoli. Yakoba wamba kafunta, wamba kashakama chakumwena zo-o, mumesu mwawunda be-te-te-e, niwakumutiyisha woma nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
